        <Textbox Name="Textbox53">
          <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
          <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
          <Paragraphs>
            <Paragraph>
              <TextRuns>
                <TextRun>
                  <Value> It is agreed that the goods describd herein are accepted in apprent good order and condition(except as noted)for carriage SUBJECT TO THE CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT ON THE REVERSE HEREOF, ALL GOODS MAY BE CARRIED BY ANY OTHER MEANS INCLUDING ROAD OR ANY OTHER CARRIER UNLESS SPECIFIC CONTRARY INSTRUCTION ARE GIVEN HEREON BY THE SHIPER, AND SHIPPER AGREES THAT THE SHIPMENT MAY BE CARRIED VIA INTERMEDIATE STOPPING PLACES WHICH THE NOTICE CONCERNING CARRIER'S, LIMITATION OF LIABILITY.Shipper may increase such limitation of liability by declaring a higher value for carriage and paying supplimental charge if required.</Value>
                  <Style>
                    <FontFamily>Verdana</FontFamily>
                    <FontSize>6.6pt</FontSize>
                  </Style>
                </TextRun>
              </TextRuns>
              <Style />
            </Paragraph>
          </Paragraphs>
          <rd:DefaultName>Textbox2</rd:DefaultName>
